    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d107-a4">

                <pb facs="0254" n="158" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg158"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 146 <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >bis.</hi>—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Williamson to Mr.
                            James.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation in Central America</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1874-04-25T11:00:00-06:36"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">April</hi> 25, 1874—11
                    a.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Go on the steamer Arizona, and take the
                    declaration of the captain, officers, and passengers in regard to the shooting
                    of Don José Maria Gonzalez, commandante of said port, and telegraph substance of
                    declaration without delay.</p>
                <p>Answer at once. Communicate facts in your knowledge without waiting for
                    declaration, but be sure to send declarations.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>GEO. WILLIAMSON.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
